<% page_title "Contact" %>

<article class="wrap measure">
  <h1 class="text-4xl">Contact</h1>

  <p class="mt-6 text-ink-600">
    Licensing questions, content-ID disputes, custom work, or anything else:
  </p>

  <dl class="mt-8 space-y-4">
    <div>
      <dt class="meta uppercase">Email</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1">
        <a class="underline" href="mailto:hello@ai-pop-music.invalid">hello@ai-pop-music.invalid</a>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="meta uppercase">Orders</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 text-ink-600">
        Quote your order number (it starts with APM-) so we can find it immediately.
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <p class="meta mt-10">
    There is no contact form: a form would need a spam defence and a queue, and email works.
  </p>
</article>
